  {
    "id": "comp-17",
    "number": 17,
    "title": "Virtual Destructor vs Normal Destructor",
    "topicId": "topic-9",
    "headers": [
      "Aspect",
      "Normal Destructor",
      "Virtual Destructor"
    ],
    "rows": [
      [
        "**`delete basePtr` (pointing to `Derived`)**",
        "**Undefined Behavior** (usually skips `~Derived()`)",
        "Calls `~Derived()` then `~Base()` safely"
      ],
      [
        "**Memory Overhead**",
        "0 bytes (`vptr` not needed if no other virtuals)",
        "Adds 1 `vptr` per object (if class had no other virtuals)"
      ],
      [
        "**When to Use**",
        "Concrete / value classes (`Point`, `std::vector`)",
        "Any polymorphic base class (`public virtual` or `protected` non-virtual)"
      ]
    ],
    "codeExample": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "comp-18",
    "number": 18,
    "title": "Rule of 3 vs Rule of 5 vs Rule of 0",
    "topicId": "topic-30",
    "headers": [
      "Aspect",
      "Rule of 3",
      "Rule of 5",
      "Rule of 0"
    ],
    "rows": [
      [
        "**Standard**",
        "C++98 / C++03",
        "C++11 / C++17+",
        "Modern C++11 / C++17+ (Best Practice)"
      ],
      [
        "**Special Functions Managed**",
        "`~T()`, `T(const T&)`, `operator=(const T&)`",
        "Rule of 3 + `T(T&&)` + `operator=(T&&)`",
        "**Zero** custom special functions!"
      ],
      [
        "**Resource Strategy**",
        "Manual `new`/`delete` inside class",
        "Manual `new`/`delete` + fast `noexcept` moves",
        "Delegate to `std::unique_ptr`, `std::vector`, `std::string`"
      ],
      [
        "**When to Use**",
        "Legacy codebases",
        "Writing low-level RAII wrappers/containers",
        "95%+ of application/domain classes"
      ]
    ],
    "codeExample": "",
    "note": ""
